ence.</source> <volume>290</volume>:<fpage>1571</fpage>&#x02013;1574.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11090354</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib46"><citation citation-type="journal">Ziegler, D.M., and L.L. Poulsen. <year>1977</year>. Protein disulfide bond synthesis: a possible intracellular mechanism. <source>Trends Biochem. Sci.</source> <volume>2</volume>:<fpage>79</fpage>&#x02013;81.</citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>